error[SC0104]: this `#ifdef` asks about a name the implementation may define
   ╭─[ a_name_its_compilers_disagree_on_is_refused_for_msvc.c:6:1 ]
   │
 6 │ #ifdef __x86_64__
   │ ┬  
   │ ╰── directive begins here
───╯
  = note: `__x86_64__` is reserved for the implementation (C17 7.1.3), and whether it is defined depends on the compiler, so none of this conditional's groups is compiled
  = help: say whether the build defines it: `-D __x86_64__` if it does, `-U __x86_64__` if it does not
